[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2599710271","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/101738#issuecomment-2599710271","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/101738","id":2599710271,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6a9G4_","user":{"login":"Rindbee","id":30386067,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMwMzg2MDY3","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/30386067?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rindbee","html_url":"https://github.com/Rindbee","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rindbee/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rindbee/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rindbee/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rindbee/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rindbee/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rindbee/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rindbee/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rindbee/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rindbee/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-01-18T13:05:41Z","updated_at":"2025-01-18T13:07:54Z","body":"After creating the `InputEventKey`, but before copying the `Shortcut` resource for the first time, you did not save it.\n\nModifications to copied resources also don't seem to be saved.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2599710271/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2599810338","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/101738#issuecomment-2599810338","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/101738","id":2599810338,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6a9fUi","user":{"login":"Ketei","id":137458469,"node_id":"U_kgDOCDFzJQ","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/137458469?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ketei","html_url":"https://github.com/Ketei","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ketei/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ketei/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ketei/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ketei/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ketei/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ketei/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ketei/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ketei/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ketei/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-01-18T18:00:15Z","updated_at":"2025-01-18T18:18:28Z","body":"> After creating the `InputEventKey`, but before copying the `Shortcut` resource for the first time, you did not save it.\n\n> Modifications to copied resources also don't seem to be saved.\n\nA few observations:\n\nFirst, you are correct, I didn't save. But I shouldn't have to if the shortcut resource was to maintain behaviour consistency with other resources, this is, you can change the resource values and switch to other things without losing the edited data, then, when running the project (which triggers a save) it should write the correct data on the resources. If you analyse other resources, you can create and edit those resources without saving and the file will be created but the edited values won't be saved UNTIL you run the project or manually trigger a save.\n\nSecond, if the values weren't being saved to the resource or not being applied there is no reason the inspector should be showing other data. This is, if my resource has no event, and no event is saved to it, it shouldn't show that the resource has 1 event. In here, the resource file has no event, but it is incorrectly displaying that it has 1 event to key 48 (shortcut_0.tres). Meanwhile the shortcut_1.tres resource is showing in the inspector that it has 1 event to key 49, but if you open the resource in a text editor you'll see that it is, instead, key 48.\n\nThird, if the issue really was with the need to be saving after each edition of a resource, then this issue would **_ALSO_** occur if I create the resources following a similar method, but it doesn't. As I stated in the initial issue, \"[...]When creating the shortcuts directly (Create New -> Resource) this didn't happen.[...]\". You can see in this video I followed the exact same procedure WITHOUT duplicating and without saving either, yet, the values were correctly saved.\n\nhttps://github.com/user-attachments/assets/dd73e061-5ad5-4bea-b353-b5d153771c7f\n\nThis is why I believe this to be a bug. If it is intended that when creating a resource via the submenus it saves correctly and when creating it via duplication it functions differently I believe it should, at least, be documented on the Resource class page.\n\nLastly, I want to point that you are correct in the fact that if I save after I edit each resource (create -> edit -> save -> duplicate -> edit...) then the correct values will be written to the resources. Still this shouldn't be necessary if you consider my previous three points.\n\nOn a side note, I just tested this with other resources (`Animation` & `ButtonGroup` for simplicity) and this behaviour of saving something and displaying another thing remains if the resource was created via duplication. As such, I'll update the title to reflect the issue. I'll also include your observation about not saving it after each creation.","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2599810338/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2600381442","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/101738#issuecomment-2600381442","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/101738","id":2600381442,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6a_qwC","user":{"login":"Rindbee","id":30386067,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMwMzg2MDY3","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/30386067?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rindbee","html_url":"https://github.com/Rindbee","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rindbee/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rindbee/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rindbee/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rindbee/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rindbee/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rindbee/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rindbee/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rindbee/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rindbee/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-01-19T01:34:29Z","updated_at":"2025-01-19T01:45:43Z","body":"I think I know what you mean. It forgot to save this certain resource before running the scene. Maybe duplicating destroyed the unsaved flag.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2600381442/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2600467572","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/101738#issuecomment-2600467572","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/101738","id":2600467572,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6a__x0","user":{"login":"Ketei","id":137458469,"node_id":"U_kgDOCDFzJQ","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/137458469?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ketei","html_url":"https://github.com/Ketei","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ketei/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ketei/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ketei/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ketei/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ketei/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ketei/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ketei/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ketei/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ketei/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-01-19T02:02:08Z","updated_at":"2025-01-19T02:05:04Z","body":"I'm unsure as to what happened so any guess from my part is highly speculative and I would like to refrain from wild guesses as to not impede those more knowledgeable than me reading the issue, but I find it interesting that the resource was written with the value of the resource that preceded it with the exception of the last resource created. I'm guessing this last one is the correct value because, as mentioned before, creating a resource and saving after editing it writes the correct value, so it makes sense the last one would have the correct data. To illustrate with my shortcut example:\n\nAssigned Shortcuts:\n[0, 1, 2, 3]\n\nSaved Shortcuts:\n[N/A, 0, 1, 3]\n\nHopefully this comment is relevant.","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2600467572/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3094416682","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/101738#issuecomment-3094416682","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/101738","id":3094416682,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc64cQ0q","user":{"login":"rsubtil","id":6501975,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY1MDE5NzU=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/6501975?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/rsubtil","html_url":"https://github.com/rsubtil","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rsubtil/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rsubtil/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rsubtil/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rsubtil/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rsubtil/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rsubtil/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rsubtil/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rsubtil/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rsubtil/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-07-20T10:09:43Z","updated_at":"2025-07-20T10:09:43Z","body":"Still valid on `v4.4.1.stable` and `v4.5.beta3`","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3094416682/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3094512007","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/101738#issuecomment-3094512007","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/101738","id":3094512007,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc64coGH","user":{"login":"Rindbee","id":30386067,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMwMzg2MDY3","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/30386067?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rindbee","html_url":"https://github.com/Rindbee","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rindbee/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rindbee/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rindbee/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rindbee/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rindbee/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rindbee/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rindbee/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rindbee/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rindbee/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-07-20T13:12:47Z","updated_at":"2025-07-20T13:12:47Z","body":"There are two types of resources: `Shortcut` and `InputEventKey`. This issue is mainly caused by the following reasons:\n\n1. Creating a tres file will create and save `Shortcut`, but will not save `InputEventKey` because it has not been created yet.\n2. Assigning and configuring `InputEventKey` will update the data in memory. However, it will not be saved automatically, that is, the data in the resource file will not be updated.\n3. Duplicating the tres file will duplicate the latest data of both resources in the memory and save them in the new file.\n4. Running the scene will only save the resource currently being edited, but not all unsaved resources.\n","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3094512007/reactions","total_count":3,"+1":3,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3117815285","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/101738#issuecomment-3117815285","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/101738","id":3117815285,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc651hX1","user":{"login":"KoBeWi","id":2223172,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIyMjMxNzI=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/2223172?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi","html_url":"https://github.com/KoBeWi","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-07-25T13:24:54Z","updated_at":"2025-07-25T13:24:54Z","body":"> Running the scene will only save the resource currently being edited, but not all unsaved resources.\n\nSounds like this is the bug here. Running a scene should save everything that needs saving (if `save_before_running` is enabled).","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3117815285/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3117862620","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/101738#issuecomment-3117862620","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/101738","id":3117862620,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc651s7c","user":{"login":"Rindbee","id":30386067,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMwMzg2MDY3","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/30386067?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rindbee","html_url":"https://github.com/Rindbee","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rindbee/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rindbee/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rindbee/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rindbee/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rindbee/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rindbee/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rindbee/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rindbee/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rindbee/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-07-25T13:39:48Z","updated_at":"2025-07-25T13:48:34Z","body":"> Sounds like this is the bug here. Running a scene should save everything that needs saving (if `save_before_running` is enabled).\n\nAnother problem is that the edited state of a resource is marked in `UndoRedo::_process_operation_list()`. That is, only operations tracked by `UndoRedo` will have `edited` set to true. But some editor plugins do not expose the necessary methods in ClassDB. \n\n\nhttps://github.com/godotengine/godot/blob/967e2d499acd7d03a3e69002d373880e43fe0e45/editor/inspector/input_event_editor_plugin.cpp#L52-L56","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3117862620/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3145186789","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/101738#issuecomment-3145186789","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/101738","id":3145186789,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc67d73l","user":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-08-01T16:53:00Z","updated_at":"2025-08-01T16:53:00Z","body":"Partially fixed by #109016","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3145186789/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null}]